@title 3D view: type a position, then drag a device across the plate, undo both
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768
# Fixed 1366x768 window points: the cube (1296,108), K1 (522,436, then 630,413 once it is at X 150) and the Position X box (1081,647) are where the front view puts them at that size.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click 1296 108
wait 40
click 522 436
wait 20
expect "Top left from the plate"
click 1081 647
key ctrl+a
text 150
key Enter
wait 30
expect "150, 228 mm"
shot typed-position
drag 630 413 750 413
wait 30
expect_not "150, 228 mm"
shot dragged
key ctrl+z
wait 20
key ctrl+z
wait 30
expect "55, 228 mm"
shot undone
check_layout
